<title>HONG KONG: Pacific Andes 1996 net HK$176.43 mln.</title>
<headline>Pacific Andes 1996 net HK$176.43 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   36.5	  vs  9.6 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0	   vs  2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  109.11 gain vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    176.43	vs  42.48</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,179.72    vs  524.37</p>
<p>    Company name		 Pacific Andes International</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 17-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Pacific Andes is a frozen seafood supplier.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year-end to December 31 from September 30. The comparative figures are for nine months ended December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>On September 17, 1996, Pacific Andes (Holdings) Ltd, a wholly owned subsidiary of the company, issued a prospectus in Singapore to offer for subscription and sale to the public of 61.25 million shares, comprising 30.63 million shares owned by the company and 30.63 million new shares.</p>
</text>
